# Only server/ is ever copied into the image; keep everything else - above all
# the desktop app's node_modules and its 100MB+ installers - out of the build
# context so Render is not uploading the whole project on every deploy.
#
# `!server` re-includes the directory itself: excluding a parent and then
# re-including paths underneath it is unreliable, so allow the directory and
# prune inside it instead.
*
!server
server/node_modules
server/dist
